{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38883","headline":"山中寡妇 · 杜荀鹤","name":"山中寡妇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夫因兵死守蓬茅，麻苎衣衫鬓发焦。\n桑柘废来犹纳税，田园荒後尚徵苗。\n时挑野菜和根煮，旋斫生柴带叶烧。\n任是深山更深处，也应无计避征徭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷六九二、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》杜荀鹤条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）"}